<dt>net check</dt><dd>the guest&#39;s eth0 counted received 632.0 MiB, sent 83.6 MiB since it booted, to its last sample; the host counted received 624.1 MiB, sent 83.3 MiB on the tap over the whole lease (guest minus host: received &#43;7.9 MiB, sent &#43;319.3 KiB)</dd>
<dt>agent cpu</dt><dd>0.7s, 0.3% of the guest&#39;s busy CPU since it booted (its own count)</dd>
<dt>agent sent</dt><dd>17 batches accepted, so at most 1.1 MiB of batch bodies on the tap, plus HTTP and TCP framing and any batches the node refused (it counts the batches it accepted, not their bytes)</dd>
</dl>
